        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6d11e41d-4ec7-4c21-abe9-b877811fbdcf).Image",
        "Description": "Five individuals have been marked for termination in Santa Fortuna. At the top of the list is Britanic Reséndez Dávila, accompanied by Emiliano Acuna, Danny Crespo, Badomero Murillo, and Amaranto Benítez.\r\rTheir time is up. Your assignment is simple: eliminate all five targets and leave no loose ends.\r\rThe client has made one request particularly clear: Emiliano Acuna must meet his end through an electrocution accident.\r\rSanta Fortuna is full of opportunities. Make use of them.",
